  "description": "Never lose what you've copied again. Access your clipboard history instantly and paste any previous item with a single click or keyboard shortcut.\n\n          Key features:\n          • Tracks text, images, URIs, colors & files\n          • Automatically hides passwords for privacy\n          • Delete or clear individual items on demand\n          • Multi-monitor support for seamless workflows\n          • Configurable history limit to stay in control\n\n          Your clipboard, supercharged.",
